{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tpo-ecommerce-2025-vm",
    "name": "TPO E-Commerce - Backend API (VM 192.168.56.2)",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints para el backend del TPO E-Commerce corriendo dentro de la VM.\n\nTecnologías:\n- Spring Boot 3.x\n- Spring Security + JWT\n- MySQL 8\n- Java 17\n\nCredenciales de Prueba:\n- Admin: admin@market.com / admin123 (ROL: ADMIN)\n- Usuario: juan@market.com / 123456 (ROL: USER)\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n⚙️ CONFIGURACIÓN DEL ENVIRONMENT (IMPORTANTE)\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nSi ya tenés un Environment previo con localhost, ACTUALIZÁ estas variables:\n\n┌─────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Variable    │ Valor Correcto para VM                             │\n├─────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ baseUrl     │ http://192.168.56.2:8080                           │\n│ adminEmail  │ admin@market.com                                   │\n│ adminPass   │ admin123                                           │\n│ userEmail   │ juan@market.com                                    │\n│ userPass    │ 123456                                             │\n│ authToken   │ (se auto-genera al hacer login, dejalo vacío)      │\n│ token       │ (se auto-genera al hacer login, dejalo vacío)      │\n└─────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n📌 ALTERNATIVA: Si no tenés Environment configurado, esta colección\n   usa variables internas (sección \"variable\" al final del JSON).\n   En ese caso, seleccioná \"No Environment\" en Postman.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nInstrucciones de Uso:\n1) Ejecuta primero 'Login Admin' o 'Login Usuario'\n2) El token JWT se guarda en {{authToken}} automáticamente\n3) Los endpoints protegidos lo usarán en el header Authorization\n\nServidores:\n- VM (Backend directo): http://192.168.56.2:8080\n- VM (Frontend Nginx - SOLO /api): http://192.168.56.2\n\nDocumentación: Ver README.md del proyecto",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "tpo-ecommerce"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Health Status (Actuator)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Application is UP\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql(\"UP\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Database is UP\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.components && jsonData.components.db) {",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData.components.db.status).to.eql(\"UP\");",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verifica el estado de salud de la aplicación Spring Boot y sus componentes (DB, DiskSpace, etc.)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Endpoints de Actuator para monitoreo"
    },
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar Usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 or 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Token JWT recibido\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.token) { pm.environment.set(\"authToken\", jsonData.token); }",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.token).to.exist;",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Usuario\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Test Postman\",\n  \"email\": \"test.postman{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"nombreUsuario\": \"testuser{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"password\": \"test123\",\n  \"telefono\": \"1134567890\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle Falsa 123, Buenos Aires\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "auth", "register" ]
            },
            "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario y retorna un JWT"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Token JWT recibido\", function () { var j=pm.response.json(); pm.expect(j.token).to.exist; pm.environment.set(\"authToken\", j.token); });"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@market.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "auth", "login" ]
            },
            "description": "Login como ADMIN, guarda token en {{authToken}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login Usuario Regular",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Token JWT recibido\", function () { var j=pm.response.json(); pm.expect(j.token).to.exist; pm.environment.set(\"authToken\", j.token); });"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"juan@market.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "auth", "login" ]
            },
            "description": "Login como USER, guarda token en {{authToken}}"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Autenticación y registro con JWT"
    },
